== Trivia ==

* It is based of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Cat_Skibidi_Toilet Cat Skibidi Toilet] From the Series. It appeared in the Skibidi Toilet series in the early episodes where the Toilet Cameraman took a look into the first skibidi base.
* It makes the sound ‘meow’ when it runs.
* It is the fastest toilet in the game, surpassing Glitch Toilet's speed, albeit with very low HP.
* It does 200 damage to your city.
